name    infocom
prog    /dd/CMDS/infocom /dd/GAMES/INFORM/dejavu.z3
# The Infocom Z-machine, playing a story file that ships here -- compiled
# with Inform and left in GAMES/INFORM.  `look' is the one command every
# adventure understands.
rate    0.5
wait    8
snap    opening
key     \r
wait    3
keys    look
key     \r
wait    5
snap    looked
absent  Can't install trap handler
absent  can't open
